{"t": "19:35:08", "kind": "question", "slot": "dyn:complaint.pain_rating+M.anticoagulant", "text": "I've noted that. On a scale of 0 to 10, where 10 is the worst pain imaginable, how bad is his pain right now? Also, does he take any blood thinners like warfarin or apixaban?", "fields": ["complaint.pain_rating", "M.anticoagulant"], "offered": ["complaint.pain_rating", "M.anticoagulant", "complaint.compartment_syndrome_symptoms", "E.fall_height_meters", "M.medications", "A.allergies"]}
